<!--
JS_Class_Template_Lookup_Test - Main entry point

This test validates that when a component is instantiated and:
1. The component's class exists (Form_Base extends Jqhtml_Component)
2. The component's class HAS NO template registered
3. A child class extends the component's class and HAS a template (Text_Form extends Form_Base)

Then the framework should walk the JS prototype chain and use the child's template.
-->
<Define:JS_Class_Template_Lookup_Test>
  <% console.log('[TEST] Starting JS class template lookup test'); %>
  <Tester />
  <% console.log('[TEST] Tester component rendered'); %>
</Define:JS_Class_Template_Lookup_Test>
